					"nextDialogs": [
						730030713,
						730030715
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Arana"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030713,
					"content": "Isn't this the thing we saw before...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030714
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730030714,
					"content": "Phew... You scared Paimon! Paimon thought you were a talking vegetable...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030716
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030716,
					"content": "Not vegetable, Arana. Arana is friend, Aranara.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030717,
						730030722
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Arana"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030717,
					"content": "\"Aranara\"...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030718
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730030718,
					"content": "Eh? Did you say Aranara? Now that Paimon's really looking at you, Paimon thinks we really have seen you before...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030719
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030719,
					"content": "\"Arana\"...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030720
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730030720,
					"content": "Paimon thinks we heard this name when Iotham was telling that story before...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030721
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030721,
					"content": "Yes. Nara Iotham is Arana's friend.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030727
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Arana"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030727,
					"content": "#Aranara are children of the forest, we live with trees. Not like you, Nara {NICKNAME}. You are the child of dandelion, always traveling.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030728
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Arana"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030728,
					"content": "#How do you know {NICKNAME}'s name?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030729
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030729,
					"content": "How Arana knows, not important. But Arana wants to help Narana, this very important.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030730,
						730030732
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Arana"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030730,
					"content": "Narana... That's almost a tongue-twister.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030731
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730030731,
					"content": "You want to help Rana? What do you need us to do?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030733
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030733,
					"content": "Thank you, you good Nara. She is Arana's very important friend. So, Arana will protect her.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030734
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Arana"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030734,
					"content": "#But that is not enough. To heal Narana, we need Bija. Nara {NICKNAME} must go to Vanarana and ask everyone to help get Bija.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030735,
						730030736
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Arana"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030735,
					"content": "Bija...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030737
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730030737,
					"content": "Narana got corroded by Marana, very serious. Bad bugs are biting tree roots. Trees will wither, fruits will rot.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030738
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Arana"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030738,
					"content": "Nara's life is like tree, bad bugs, like Marana. Only Bija can make Narana better.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030739
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Arana"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030739,
					"content": "Uh... So, we need to go somewhere called \"Vanarana\" and come up with a way to get this Bija, right? Then we can heal Rana?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030740
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030740,
					"content": "Mm-hmm.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030741,
						730030744
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Arana"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030741,
					"content": "Then Rana's current condition...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030742
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730030742,
					"content": "No worry. Arana will be here and fight Marana corrosion. So, Rana will not get worse.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030743
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Arana"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030743,
					"content": "But with no Bija, Rana will not get better either.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030745
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Arana"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030745,
					"content": "Follow the forest path, keep going towards where water comes from, then you will reach Vanarana.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030746
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Arana"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030746,
					"content": "Then sing.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030747,
						730030748
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Arana"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030747,
					"content": "Sing?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030750
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730030750,
					"content": "(A melody is rising up in my mind...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030751
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730030751,
					"content": "This is the Rhythm of the Great Dream. Sing it to enter Vanarana.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030752
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Arana"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030752,
					"content": "Enter our dreams, our world.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Arana"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030748,
					"content": "That'll attract Whopperflowers...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030749
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730030749,
					"content": "#Nara {NICKNAME}, very funny.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030750
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Arana"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030744,
					"content": "Got it. How do we get there?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030745
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730030736,
					"content": "What's that?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030737
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730030732,
					"content": "What do you need me to do?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030733
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730030722,
					"content": "\"Arana\"...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030723
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730030723,
					"content": "Paimon thinks we heard this name when Iotham was telling that story before...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030724
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030724,
					"content": "Yes. Nara Iotham is Arana's friend.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030725
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Arana"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030725,
					"content": "\"Aranara\"...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030726
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730030726,
					"content": "Eh? Did you say Aranara? Now that Paimon's really looking at you, Paimon thinks we really have seen you before...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030727
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030715,
					"content": "Vegetable...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030716
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730030708,
					"content": "What was that again?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030709
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730030709,
					"content": "Paimon thinks they said it could resist the Marana corrosion or something... It had a funny name.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030710
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030710,
					"content": "It is Ararakalari. It can fight Marana. Ararakalari, NOT a funny name.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030711
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Arana"
				}
			]
		},
		{
